			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1554605">
									

<p>Actually, is there anything in the articles that would lead us to believe that the two use different languages? The last addendum of the space hearts suggests that whatever created them was originally from this neck of the woods (possibly our progenitors?), and refer to similar enough subject matter that I'm tempted to peg this as the same civilization and language. Hell, my headcanon wants to say that the monolith that with the engraved warnings from Stalin and other historical leaders about &quot;the destroyers&quot; could be linked as well&#8230;</p>
<p>EDIT: the cyclical take on the name Pattern Screamers is an interesting one. Personally I ended up reading it as something closer to &quot;Anti-spirals&quot; in the Gurren Lagaan sense&#8230;</p>

